# Charmonium peaking background for B0 -> K*0 l+ l-:
# B0 -> J/psi(-> l+ l-) K*0, same visible final state as the signal.
# Vetoed in real analyses with windows in m(l+l-).

Alias      B0sig        B0
Alias      anti-B0sig   anti-B0
ChargeConj B0sig        anti-B0sig

Alias      K*0sig       K*0
Alias      anti-K*0sig  anti-K*0
ChargeConj K*0sig       anti-K*0sig

Alias      J/psisig     J/psi
ChargeConj J/psisig     J/psisig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.000  B0sig anti-B0sig B0 anti-B0   VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay B0sig
1.000  J/psisig K*0sig               SVV_HELAMP 0.6417 3.29 0.7556 0.0 0.1312 0.13;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-B0sig

Decay J/psisig
0.500  e+  e-                        PHOTOS VLL;
0.500  mu+ mu-                       PHOTOS VLL;
Enddecay

Decay K*0sig
1.000  K+ pi-                        VSS;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-K*0sig

End
